#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:1 af133889e90646bab3428eed0f33b4d3
msgid "Fitting & statistics"
msgstr "フィッティングと統計"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:3 c9710988c7a34fb599229aa97e538911
msgid ""
"Curve fitting, ARIMA, decomposition, correlation and non-Gaussian "
"statistics."
msgstr "曲線フィッティング、ARIMA、分解、相関、非ガウス統計。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:9 9f12deab3a7140fea564efd63f407142
msgid "Fitting: Spectral Line Analysis"
msgstr "フィッティング: スペクトル線解析"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:13 0e7edbba97cd4869bd03433d1c8092bc
msgid ""
"Fit `TimeSeries` or `FrequencySeries` data with `iminuit`-backed least-"
"squares fitting and error estimation."
msgstr ""
"`iminuit` を使った最小二乗フィッティングと誤差推定で `TimeSeries` / `FrequencySeries` "
"データをフィットします。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:16 6ffb624786a24841823da8587727d90e
msgid "ARIMA: Time Series Forecasting"
msgstr "ARIMA: 時系列予測"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:20 9f5c98ec166a4cb2b8927c64dfe9d6a6
msgid ""
"Model and forecast time series with AR, MA, ARMA, and ARIMA/SARIMAX "
"methods added to `TimeSeries`."
msgstr "`TimeSeries` に追加された AR、MA、ARMA、ARIMA/SARIMAX の手法で時系列をモデル化・予測します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:23 6c6153a1f0804a62a926a7d1e6d98061
msgid "Decomposition Analysis: PCA, ICA, and Eigenmodes"
msgstr "分解解析: PCA・ICA と固有モード"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:27 92192b0585264c9dabe7041ab24d7d4c
msgid ""
"Principal and Independent Component Analysis on `TimeSeriesMatrix` via "
"`pca()` / `ica()`."
msgstr "`pca()` / `ica()` を介した `TimeSeriesMatrix` 上の主成分分析・独立成分分析。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:30 a3a6f22ee6d04a449d5f2280a2157763
msgid "Correlation Analysis: Statistical Methods"
msgstr "相関解析: 統計的手法"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:34 e81424c48fea4eab9bf4cc21ecf64f82
msgid ""
"Pearson, Kendall, and other correlation measures between `TimeSeries` "
"objects for noise hunting and nonlinear coupling."
msgstr "`TimeSeries` オブジェクト間の Pearson、Kendall などの相関指標。ノイズハンティングや非線形カップリングの調査に使います。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:37 7e53cd35c62e47b786de205c83139561
msgid "Non-Gaussian Noise Analysis: Rayleigh and Gaussian-Chi"
msgstr "非ガウス雑音解析: Rayleigh と Gaussian-Chi"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/index.md:41 d7f7d448f4cc49fc8cfde98a1d7b16be
msgid ""
"A non-Gaussian noise analysis toolkit based on Rayleigh and Gaussian-Chi "
"statistics."
msgstr "Rayleigh 統計と Gaussian-Chi 統計に基づく非ガウス雑音解析ツールキット。"

